    <item>
      <title>Congress Returns to a New Political Reality</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-08/congress-returns-to-a-new-political-reality-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">3bb60312329108063df90bd9</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 15:33:13 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>On Bloomberg This Weekend, former Republican strategist Leslie Shedd and former Democratic strategist John McCarthy discuss how both parties are recalibrating after Democrats’ sweeping midterm victories and what Congress could accomplish before power shifts in January. Speaking with hosts David Gura and Christina Ruffini, they examine the coming congressional leadership fights, the pressure to address affordability and how Democrats and Republicans could position themselves for the next two years. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
